      "notes": {
        "summary": "Content files load in the order Morrowind.exe gives them.",
        "changed": [
          "Master files come first, then plugins, each group oldest first by modification time, as in Morrowind.exe. Plugin headers are no longer read to sort by dependency.",
          "The GameFile list ends at the first missing number, and GameFile and Archive keys match whatever their case.",
          "A GameFile that is not found stops the list with a warning, as Morrowind.exe does, instead of failing the import."
        ]
      },
